/* Subpestanya Restriccions INSPIRE*/
T_Limitations_public_acces,	"Limitations on public access according the Articles 13(1) of the INSPIRE directive"
Conditions_Access_and_Use,	"Conditions applying to access and use"
T_Limitations_explicacio,	"Limitations on public access can be set on the base of the following reasons ([INSPIRE Directive], Article 13)"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_a, "13(1)(a): the confidentiality of the proceedings of public authorities, where such confidentiality is provided for by law"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_b, "13(1)(b): international relations, public security or national defence"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_c, "13(1)(c): the course of justice, the ability of any person to receive a fair trial or the ability of a public authority to conduct an enquiry of a criminal or disciplinary nature"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_d_1, "13(1)(d): the confidentiality of commercial or industrial information, where such confidentiality is provided for by national or Community law to protect a legitimate economic interest, "
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_d_2, "including the public interest in maintaining statistical confidentiality and tax secrecy"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_e, "13(1)(e): intellectual property rights"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_f_1, "13(1)(f): the confidentiality of personal data and/or files relating to a natural person where that person has not consented to the disclosure of the information to the public, "
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_f_2, "where such confidentiality is provided for by national or Community law"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_g_1, "13(1)(g): the interests or protection of any person who supplied the information requested on a voluntary basis without being under, "
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_g_2, "or capable of being put under, a legal obligation to do so, unless that person has consented to the release of the information concerned"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_h, "13(1)(h): the protection of the environment to which such information relates, such as the location of rare species"
Limitacions_condicio_no_limitations,	"No limitations"
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_a_resum, "(a): confidentiality, proceedings, public authorities..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_b_resum, "(b): relations, security, defence..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_c_resum, "(c): the course of justice..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_d_resum, "(d): confidentiality, information..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_e_resum, "(e): intellectual property rights..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_f_resum, "(f): confidentiality, data, files..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_g_resum, "(g): interests, protection, person..."
Limitacions_condicio_13_1_h_resum, "(h): protection, environment..."
No_conditions_to_access_and_use,		"&No conditions to access and use"
Conditions_to_access_and_use_unknown,	"Conditions to access and use &unknown"
Other_acces_and_use_conditions,			"&Other access and use condicions"
